@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il08-nouns`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance s 47(a): the definitions that s 47 uses and s 45A(c) borrows. Row IL-08.
--
-- s 45A(c) reads "”הכנסה מבוטחת“, ”הכנסה מזכה“ ו”עמית מוטב“ – כהגדרתם בסעיף 47", so these definitions
-- are needed before s 45A can be encoded, and are taken first; the deduction itself, s 47(b)-(d), is
-- in ito-s47-deduction.l4.
--
-- Source lines 1764-1777. The amounts the definitions print (84,000; 118,800) are adjusted under
-- s 120B and are inputs (`The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`).
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 47(a) — definitions`
-- src:1764 | (א) בסעיף זה –

§§ `(1) qualifying income`

-- src:1765 | (1) ”הכנסה מזכה“ – סך כל הכנסתו החייבת של יחיד לפני הניכוי על פי סעיף זה ועל פי סעיף 47א, כמפורט להלן, לפי הענין:
-- src:1766 | (1) לגבי יחיד שהיתה לו רק הכנסת עבודה – עד לסכום של 84,000 שקלים חדשים לשנה [note: (נקוב לשנת 2004; בשנת 2023, 112,800 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2027, 116,400 ש״ח)];
-- src:1767 | (2) לגבי יחיד שלא היתה לו הכנסת עבודה – עד לסכום של 118,800 שקלים חדשים לשנה [note: (נקוב לשנת 2004; בשנת 2023, 159,600 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2027, 164,400 ש״ח)];
-- src:1768 | (3) לגבי יחיד שהיו לו הכנסת עבודה והכנסה שאינה הכנסת עבודה, בשל הכנסת עבודה – עד לסכום האמור בפסקה (1) ובשל הכנסה שאינה הכנסת עבודה – עד לסכום האמור בפסקה (2) בניכוי הכנסת העבודה שלו, או בניכוי הסכום האמור בפסקה (1), לפי הנמוך מביניהם, ובלבד שתובא בחשבון, תחילה, הכנסת העבודה שלו;
--
-- Three limbs by what income the individual had. Limb (3) states the rule for both kinds: work
-- income up to the paragraph (1) amount, counted first; then income that is not work income up to
-- the paragraph (2) amount less the work income or less the paragraph (1) amount, whichever is
-- lower. Limbs (1) and (2) are the cases of (3) with one kind at nil; they are encoded as the text
-- states them and a test asserts the three agree where they overlap.

@ref ITO s 47(a)(1), limb (1), line 1766
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(1)(1) — qualifying income of an individual with only work income:` i `,` a MEANS
    min (i's `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`)
        (a's `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income`)

@ref ITO s 47(a)(1), limb (2), line 1767
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(1)(2) — qualifying income of an individual with no work income:` i `,` a MEANS
    min (i's `taxable income not from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`)
        (a's `the amount in paragraph (2) of the definition of qualifying income`)

-- Limb (3), split into its two parts, because s 45A and s 47(b) each read one part.
@ref ITO s 47(a)(1), limb (3), line 1768: "בשל הכנסת עבודה – עד לסכום האמור בפסקה (1)"
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(1) — the part of the qualifying income that is work income:` i `,` a MEANS
    min (i's `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`)
        (a's `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income`)

-- "ובשל הכנסה שאינה הכנסת עבודה – עד לסכום האמור בפסקה (2) בניכוי הכנסת העבודה שלו, או בניכוי
-- הסכום האמור בפסקה (1), לפי הנמוך מביניהם": the lower of the two things deducted is subtracted, so
-- the room left is the paragraph (2) amount less min(work income, paragraph (1) amount). It is never
-- negative, because paragraph (2)'s amount exceeds paragraph (1)'s in every year the row has met
-- (118,800 against 84,000 as printed); the max guards it anyway.
@ref ITO s 47(a)(1), limb (3), line 1768
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(1) — the part of the qualifying income that is not work income:` i `,` a MEANS
    min (i's `taxable income not from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`)
        (max 0 (a's `the amount in paragraph (2) of the definition of qualifying income`
                    MINUS min (i's `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`)
                              (a's `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income`)))

@ref ITO s 47(a)(1), limbs (1)-(3), lines 1765-1768
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(1) — the qualifying income of` i `, at` a MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF   `work` GREATER THAN 0 AND `not work` EQUALS 0
        THEN `s 47(a)(1)(1) — qualifying income of an individual with only work income:` i `,` a
        IF   `work` EQUALS 0
        THEN `s 47(a)(1)(2) — qualifying income of an individual with no work income:` i `,` a
        OTHERWISE  `s 47(a)(1) — the part of the qualifying income that is work income:` i `,` a
              PLUS `s 47(a)(1) — the part of the qualifying income that is not work income:` i `,` a
    WHERE
        `work`     MEANS i's `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`
        `not work` MEANS i's `taxable income not from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`

-- Whether the individual had work income in the tax year: s 45A(d)(2)(b) and s 47(a)(1) both turn
-- on it ("שהיתה לו בשנת המס הכנסת עבודה").
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the individual had work income in the tax year:` i MEANS
    i's `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A` GREATER THAN 0

GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the individual's total taxable income, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A:` i MEANS
         i's `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`
    PLUS i's `taxable income not from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`

§§ `(2) provident fund — deleted`
-- src:1769 | (2) ”קופת גמל“ – [note: (נמחקה);]

§§ `(3) income for a self-employed member`

-- src:1770 | (3) ”הכנסה לעמית עצמאי“ – סך כל הכנסתו החייבת של יחיד לפני הניכוי על פי סעיף זה ועל פי סעיף 47א עד לסכום האמור בפסקה (1) להגדרה ”הכנסה מזכה“ לשנה, בניכוי הכנסתו המבוטחת;
-- Total taxable income up to the paragraph (1) amount, less insured income. Where the insured income
-- is the larger, nothing is left: read as nil, not a negative income (fork F3).
@ref ITO s 47(a)(3), line 1770
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(3) — the income for a self-employed member of` i `, at` a MEANS
    max 0 (min (`the individual's total taxable income, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A:` i)
                (a's `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income`)
           MINUS i's `insured income`)

§§ `(4) insured income`

-- src:1771 | (4) ”הכנסה מבוטחת“ – הכנסת עבודה שבשלה שילם מעביד בעד עובדו, בשנת המס, סכומים לקופת גמל לקצבה, וכן הכנסת עבודה שבשלה זכאי העובד לקצבה על פי דין או חוזה;
-- A fact of the payslip, the field `insured income`. It is work income, so it can never exceed the
-- work income; a case where it does cannot describe a year (checked by the rule below).
@ref ITO s 47(a)(4), line 1771
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 47(a)(4) — the insured income is part of the work income:` i MEANS
        i's `insured income` AT LEAST 0
    AND i's `insured income` AT MOST i's `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`

§§ `(5) additional income`

-- src:1772 | (5) ”הכנסה נוספת“ – הסכום הנמוך מבין אלה:
-- src:1773 | (1) סך כל הכנסתו החייבת של יחיד לפני הניכוי על פי סעיף זה ועל פי סעיף 47א שאינה הכנסה מבוטחת, עד לסכום האמור בפסקה (1) להגדרה ”הכנסה מזכה“ לשנה;
-- src:1774 | (2) סך כל הכנסתו החייבת של יחיד לפני הניכוי על פי סעיף זה ועל פי סעיף 47א עד לסכום השווה לשתי פעמים וחצי הסכום האמור בפסקה (1) להגדרה ”הכנסה מזכה“ לשנה, בניכוי הכנסתו המבוטחת או הסכום האמור בפסקה (1) לאותה הגדרה, לפי הגבוה מביניהם;
-- "the lower of": (1) taxable income that is not insured income, up to the paragraph (1) amount;
-- (2) taxable income up to two and a half times the paragraph (1) amount, less the insured income or
-- the paragraph (1) amount, whichever is the HIGHER. Nil where (2) would be negative (fork F3).
@ref ITO s 47(a)(5)(1), line 1773
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(5)(1) — taxable income not insured, up to the paragraph (1) amount:` i `,` a MEANS
    min (max 0 (`the individual's total taxable income, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A:` i MINUS i's `insured income`))
        (a's `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income`)

@ref ITO s 47(a)(5)(2), line 1774
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(5)(2) — taxable income up to two and a half times the paragraph (1) amount, less the insured income or that amount, whichever is higher:` i `,` a MEANS
    max 0 (min (`the individual's total taxable income, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A:` i)
                (2.5 TIMES a's `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income`)
           MINUS max (i's `insured income`) (a's `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income`))

@ref ITO s 47(a)(5), lines 1772-1774
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(5) — the additional income of` i `, at` a MEANS
    min (`s 47(a)(5)(1) — taxable income not insured, up to the paragraph (1) amount:` i `,` a)
        (`s 47(a)(5)(2) — taxable income up to two and a half times the paragraph (1) amount, less the insured income or that amount, whichever is higher:` i `,` a)

§§ `(6) individual member — deleted`
-- src:1775 | (6) ”עמית יחיד“ – [note: (נמחקה);]

§§ `(7) beneficiary member, and (8) the average wage`

-- src:1776 | (7) ”עמית מוטב“ – יחיד שבשל הכנסתו שולמו בעדו, בשנת המס, סכומים לקופת גמל לקצבה, בסכום שלא פחת מ־16% מסך כל השכר הממוצע במשק באותה שנת מס [note: (השכר הממוצע במשק (חודשי): בשנת 2023, 11,870 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2025, 12,536 ש״ח בשנת 2026, 13,769 ש״ח; 16% מהשכר הממוצע (שנתי): בשנת 2023, 22,790 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2025, 24,069 ש״ח; בשנת 2026, 26,436 ש״ח)];
-- src:1777 | (8) ”השכר הממוצע במשק“ – בהגדרתו בסעיף 3(ה3)(2);
-- The editorial note's figures are Wikisource's and are not used. "סך כל השכר הממוצע במשק באותה
-- שנת מס" is the average wage summed over the tax year: the input `the average wage in the economy,
-- in total for the tax year` (the Institute's monthly figure, s 3(e3)(2), times twelve where it is
-- the same all year; NOTES.md assumption A4). "שלא פחת" — not less than: a sum exactly at 16% qualifies.
@ref ITO s 47(a)(7), line 1776; (8), line 1777
GIVEN a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 47(a)(7) — the least sum that makes a beneficiary member, at` a MEANS
    16% TIMES a's `the average wage in the economy, in total for the tax year`

@ref ITO s 47(a)(7), line 1776
GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
      a IS A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 47(a)(7) — a beneficiary member:` i `, at` a MEANS
    i's `sums paid in the tax year to a pension provident fund in respect of the individual's income`
        AT LEAST `s 47(a)(7) — the least sum that makes a beneficiary member, at` a
